@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### The silos of the cluster with their status, from the membership table
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/silos
Accept: application/json

### Active stop grains and the silo that hosts each one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/activations
Accept: application/json

### Calls to Linz AG versus cache hits, active grains by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/stats
Accept: application/json

### The live event stream (server-sent events). Stays open; stop activation and watchers.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### Chaos: the replica that gets this request exits abruptly. 404 unless Cluster:EnableChaos is true (the AppHost turns it on).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/chaos/kill
